%% Flux d'appel FFI C++ vers Rust

sequenceDiagram
    title Appel FFI: Fichier -> C++
    
    participant RUST as Rust Codebase
    participant FFI as extern "C" Function
    participant CPP as C++ Implementation
    participant FS as Filesystem
    
    RUST->>FFI: list_mcp_files("/path")
    activate FFI
    FFI->>CPP: list_mcp_files(path.c_str())
    activate CPP
    CPP->>FS: read directory
    FS-->>CPP: file listing
    CPP-->>FFI: allocate string array
    FFI-->>RUST: return char**
    deactivate FFI
    
    Note over RUST,CPP: Mémoire allouée par C++ doit être libérée
    RUST->>FFI: free_strings(ptr, count)
